" data-register_action=\"comment\">Log in with itch.io</a> to leave a comment.</p><div id=\"community_topic_posts_5925494\" class=\"community_topic_posts_widget base_widget\"><div id=\"community_post_list_1108452\" class=\"community_post_list_widget base_widget\"><div class=\"community_post has_replies has_vote_column\" id=\"post-14756532\" data-post=\"{&quot;user_id&quot;:2206806,&quot;id&quot;:14756532}\"><div id=\"first-post\" class=\"post_anchor\"></div><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote up\"><svg height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\" role=\"img\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote down\"><svg height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" role=\"img\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/reverie-requiem\"><div style=\"background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI0Nzc1MTA2LnBuZw==/25x25%23/WADh%2FF.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/reverie-requiem\">Reverie Requiem</a></span><span class=\"post_date\" title=\"2025-11-11 16:52:42\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/14756532\">295 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"auto\"><p>How does one deal with the fact you can&#x27;t mine while swimming but a single pixel of overhang is blocking you from climbing back up the cliff? Seems to softlock me all too often unless I can get a rare moment that I can dig.</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"community_post_replies top_level_replies\"><div class=\"community_post has_vote_column is_reply\" id=\"post-14758267\" data-post=\"{&quot;user_id&quot;:2206806,&quot;id&quot;:14758267}\"><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote up\"><svg height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\" role=\"img\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote down\"><svg height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" role=\"img\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/reverie-requiem\"><div style=\"background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI0Nzc1MTA2LnBuZw==/25x25%23/WADh%2FF.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/reverie-requiem\">Reverie Requiem</a></span><span class=\"post_date\" title=\"2025-11-11 19:32:14\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/14758267\">295 days ago</a></span> <span class=\"edit_message\">(1 edit)</span> <span class=\"vote_counts\"></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"auto\"><p>It seems I can just kill and&nbsp;spawn a new player at any point if things go wrong? Didn&#x27;t invalidate my mission completion at least, but I&#x27;m quite sure my gold disappeared.</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"community_post has_vote_column is_reply\" id=\"post-15470114\" data-post=\"{&quot;user_id&quot;:6625137,&quot;id&quot;:15470114}\"><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote up\"><svg height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\" role=\"img\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote down\"><svg height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" role=\"img\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/kodenith\"><div style=\"background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI3ODMzMDY1LnBuZw==/25x25%23/wFJlNN.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/kodenith\">Kodenith</a></span><span class=\"post_date\" title=\"2026-02-13 14:28:24\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/15470114\">201 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"auto\"><p>In water, normal clonks are not great for mining and travel as they swim slow and have low oxygen, and cant do most actions. If a scenario has an &quot;aquaclonk&quot; avaiable, buy that clonk. It has a higher price, but can walk, build, dig, and climb in water.</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"community_post has_vote_column\" id=\"post-13962741\" data-post=\"{&quot;user_id&quot;:6625137,&quot;id&quot;:13962741}\"><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote up\"><svg height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\" role=\"img\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote down\"><svg height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" role=\"img\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/kodenith\"><div style=\"background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI3ODMzMDY1LnBuZw==/25x25%23/wFJlNN.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/kodenith\">Kodenith</a></span><span class=\"post_date\" title=\"2025-08-31 10:59:03\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/13962741\">1 year ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"><span class=\"upvotes\">(+1)</span></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"auto\"><p>This is my all-time favourite game.<br>Legacy Clonk is basically a fixed up and upgraded version of Clonk Rage, with new coding functions and quality of life changes.</p><p>Clonk Rage by itself is a very great game, theres millions of user-made content, tons of scenario&#x27;s and levels for you to play, each scenario is differemt and makes you think. There&#x27;s a lot of mining, exciting pvp, building, and little things that make you start scratching your head - like having to get your clonk all the way up from the bottom of a cave he fell into.</p><p>LegacyClonk expands on that, allowing for better online play, better performance and less bugs, alongside much better scenario&#x27;s because as i said it adds new coding stuff for those who make mods for the game (me!)</p><p>ive had tons of fun on this game, and probably will have even more. playing this game with friends is always a blast! I love this game so much that ive decided to work on my own mod for the game, just wish it came with the editor as i had to fetch it from clonk rage. :/</p><p>otherwise, this game is perfect! if you are looking for something old but gold, play this! you&#x27;ll play for hours</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"community_post has_vote_column\" id=\"post-7721315\" data-post=\"{&quot;user_id&quot;:1949866,&quot;id&quot;:7721315}\"><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote up\"><svg height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\" role=\"img\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote down\"><svg height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" role=\"img\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/reactorcore\"><div style=\"background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzE3MzI0MTIxLnBuZw==/25x25%23/ULU6KO.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/reactorcore\">Reactorcore</a></span><span class=\"post_date\" title=\"2023-05-01 11:54:50\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/7721315\">3 years ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"auto\"><p>I&#x27;ve played Clonk Rage for years and its one of the coolest games ever made. This version is essentially &quot;Clonk Rage Plus&quot; with improved compatibility with modern hardware, QoL additions and some content fixes that the old game had lingering.<br><br>Despite being released a long ago, this game is still a timeless classic to this day, featuring fully destructible terrain, vehicles, construction, missions, worlds, environmental simulation and dynamic liquids.<br><br>Highly recommend it to anyone for a chill singleplayer experience or for online coop.<br><br>Entire game is super moddable too!<br></p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"community_post has_vote_column\" id=\"post-7707762\" data-post=\"{&quot;user_id&quot;:8012901,&quot;id&quot;:7707762}\"><div id=\"last-post\" class=\"post_anchor\"></div><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote up\"><svg height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\" role=\"img\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\" data-register_action=\"community_vote\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\" title=\"Vote down\"><svg height=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\" role=\"img\" width=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/danghor\"><div style=\"background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzEyMDAyMDY2LmpwZw==/25x25%23/PRnynb.jpg)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/danghor\">Danghor</a></span><span class=\"post_date\" title=\"2023-04-28 17:23:38\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/7707762\">3 years ago</a></span> <span class=\"edit_message\">(5 edits)</span> <span class=\"vote_counts\"></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div class=\"post_body user_formatted\" dir=\"auto\"><p></p>\r\n<div><button itchio aria-label=\"Click to activate YouTube embed\" type=\"button\" class=\"embed_preload youtube_preload\" data-embed_code=\"&lt;iframe src=&quot;//www.youtube.com/embed/cXnK-Ad27SA&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;500&quot; height=&quot;281&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 140px; background: url(https://i.ytimg.com/vi/cXnK-Ad27SA/hqdefault.jpg) 50% 50% no-repeat; background-size: cover\"></button></div>\r\n<p>It is an outstanding game. The amount&nbsp;of&nbsp;possibilities&nbsp;you&nbsp;have&nbsp;is&nbsp;pretty&nbsp;much&nbsp;unlimited&nbsp;what&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;play&nbsp;or&nbsp;how&nbsp;you&nbsp;play.</p>\r\n<p>Some themes of LegacyClonk are Medieval, Fantasy, High Fantasy, Vampires, Western, Modern Military in different variants, Space and many more.&nbsp; It got pretty much everything.</p>\r\n<p>A summary of the genres that you can play are: Settlement, Small Melees(PvP), CO-OP(PvE), Adventure, Tower Defense, Team-Based PvP around objectives.</p>\r\n<p>The random map-generations keep the game fresh and engaging, in Settlement aswell as in PvP.</p>\r\n<p>The controls are a bit hard to learn and have many hidden things you can do but it feels really rewarding when you get better.</p>\r\n<p>Give it a try and check out the Discord-Server if you need help: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/km58ETK\" target=\"_blank\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Discord-Server</a></p>\r\n<p>Check out this amazing video at the top of a 10 Player PvP round on one of the smallest maps: <br></p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Ffulgen.itch.io%2Flegacyclonk\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><script id=\"vote_counts_tpl\" type=\"text/template\"><% if (up_score > 0) { %><span class=\"upvotes\">(+{{up_score}})</span><% } %><% if (down_score > 0) { %><span class=\"downvotes\">(-{{down_score}})</span><% } %></script></div></div></div></div><div class=\"right_col column\"><div class=\"video_embed\"><div style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative;\" id=\"video_embed_1830034\" class=\"video_embed_widget base_widget\"><iframe frameborder=\"0\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/p83_ONA9qyw\" style=\"position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%; left: 0; right: 0\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div><div class=\"screenshot_list\"><a data-image_lightbox=\"true\" href=\"https://img.itch.zo